(========================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CHAPTER 5: DISASTER ON THE LAS VEGAS SHOW FLOOR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(During our live keynote demonstration at Comdex in Chapter 5, our flagship) Tj
T*
(Series-4 prototype suffered a catastrophic thermal failure and billowed smoke) Tj
T*
(after four minutes. Post-mortem inspection revealed the exact cause: a technician) Tj
T*
(had plugged the 12V cooling fan power connector in inverted \(backwards\) and forgot) Tj
T*
(to apply thermal paste to the primary voltage regulator heatsink.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-10-23\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'Silicon Odyssey: A Founder's Memoir of Microprocessors & Near-) Tj
T*
(Bankruptcy' must verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on) Tj
T*
(Page 23 above. Any deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this) Tj
T*
(section requires formal written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
